COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.HEALTHFRIENDLYTYPE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.HEALTHFRIENDLYTYPE: 장수명주택 인증 건강친화형 주택 인증 (화면 항목: 건강친화형 주택 인증)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.HEALTHFRIENDLYTYPE_NM IS '건강친화형 주택 인증의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYCERT IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.EDUSAFETYCERT: 교육시설안전인증 시설안전(등급) (A001 우수 / A002 최우수) (화면 항목: 시설안전(등급))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYCERT_NM IS '시설안전(등급)의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.ETCINFOGUBUN IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.ETCINFOGUBUN: 기타정보';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.ETCINFOGUBUN_NM IS '기타정보의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHCIVIL IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.MATERIALTECHCIVIL: 재료기술 토목';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHCIVIL_NM IS '재료기술 토목의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHMACHINE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.MATERIALTECHMACHINE: 재료기술 기계설비';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHMACHINE_NM IS '재료기술 기계설비의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHELECTRIC IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.MATERIALTECHELECTRIC: 재료기술 전기통신';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHELECTRIC_NM IS '재료기술 전기통신의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHFIRE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.MATERIALTECHFIRE: 재료기술 소방설비';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.MATERIALTECHFIRE_NM IS '재료기술 소방설비의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTCONSTRUCTIONTECH IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SMARTCONSTRUCTIONTECH: 스마트건설 스마트건설기술 (화면 항목: 스마트건설)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTCONSTRUCTIONTECH_NM IS '스마트건설의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.PROJECTGUBUNTITLE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.PROJECTGUBUNTITLE: 표준폴더1 구분타이틀';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EXCHANGERATE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.EXCHANGERATE: 사업비 공통 환율 (기준통화 -> 원화) (화면 항목: 환율)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EXCHANGEDATE IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.EXCHANGEDATE: 사업비 공통 환율 기준일 (화면 항목: 기준일)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.PRETRANSFERYN1 IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.PRETRANSFERYN1: 표준폴더1 사전이관여부 (A001 사전이관) (화면 항목: 사전이관여부)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.PRETRANSFERYN1_NM IS '표준폴더1 사전이관 여부의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.PRETRANSFERYN2 IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.PRETRANSFERYN2: 표준폴더2 사전이관여부 (A001 사전이관) (화면 항목: 사전이관여부)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.PRETRANSFERYN2_NM IS '표준폴더2 사전이관 여부의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYINDOOR IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.EDUSAFETYINDOOR: 교육시설안전인증 실내환경안전(등급) (A001 우수 / A002 최우수) (화면 항목: 실내환경안전(등급))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYINDOOR_NM IS '실내환경안전(등급)의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYOUTDOOR IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.EDUSAFETYOUTDOOR: 교육시설안전인증 외부환경안전(등급) (A001 우수 / A002 최우수) (화면 항목: 외부환경안전(등급))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.EDUSAFETYOUTDOOR_NM IS '외부환경안전(등급)의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.OPERATIONPMNM IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.OPERATIONPMNM: 운영PM';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SALESPMID IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SALESPMID: 영업PM 사번 (화면 항목: 영업PMID)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SALESPAID IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SALESPAID: 영업PA 사번 (화면 항목: 영업PAID)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.OPERATIONPMID IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.OPERATIONPMID: 운영PM 사번 (화면 항목: 운영PMID)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.OPERATIONPAID IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.OPERATIONPAID: 운영PA 사번 (화면 항목: 운영PAID)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.DATACENTERCAPACITY IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.DATACENTERCAPACITY: 시설 규모 Unit - MW(데이터센터 수전용량) (화면 항목: MW(데이터센터 수전용량))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.WITHDRAWPLAN_DATE1 IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.WITHDRAWPLAN_DATE1: 표준폴더1 철수예정일 (관리자 전용) (화면 항목: 철수예정일)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.WITHDRAWPLAN_DATE2 IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.WITHDRAWPLAN_DATE2: 표준폴더2 철수예정일 (관리자 전용) (화면 항목: 철수예정일)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSK IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SMARTLOGISTICSK: 스마트물류센터인증 여부 (A001 스마트물류센터인증) (화면 항목: 스마트물류센터인증)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSK_NM IS '스마트물류센터인증의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSPC IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SMARTLOGISTICSPC: 스마트물류센터인증 예비인증 등급 (A001~A005 1등급~5등급) (화면 항목: 예비인증(등급))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSPC_NM IS '스마트물류센터인증 예비인증(등급)의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSMC IS 'FW_PROJECT_INFO.SMARTLOGISTICSMC: 스마트물류센터인증 본인증 등급 (A001~A005 1등급~5등급) (화면 항목: 본인증(등급))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.SMARTLOGISTICSMC_NM IS '스마트물류센터인증 본인증(등급)의 코드 이름(여러 개면 저장 순서대로 '', ''로 이음)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECTS.ROOT_FOLDER_YN IS '프로젝트 폴더가 있는지(Y/N). FW_PROJECTS.FOLDER_ID의 폴더가 FW_FOLDERS에 있으면 Y';


-- METAECM.V_ECM_PROJECT_DETAILS source

CREATE OR REPLACE FORCE VIEW "METAECM"."V_ECM_PROJECT_DETAILS" ("PROJECT_INFO_DETAIL_ID", "PROJECT_ID", "GUBUN", "FIELD_NAME", "PROPERTYVALUE1", "PROPERTYVALUE1_NM", "PROPERTYVALUE2", "PROPERTYVALUE3", "PROPERTYVALUE4", "SORTORDER") AS
SELECT D.PROJECT_INFO_DETAIL_ID, D.PROJECT_ID, D.GUBUN, UPPER(D.GUBUN) AS FIELD_NAME, D.PROPERTYVALUE1,
       CASE UPPER(D.GUBUN)
           WHEN N'SECURITYLEVEL' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                       FROM FW_CODE C
                                       WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'SECURITYLEVEL' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                         AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PROJECTGUBUN' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                      FROM FW_CODE C
                                      WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PROJECTGUBUN' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                        AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'CITYBEFORE' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                    FROM FW_CODE C
                                    WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'CITYBEFORE' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                      AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'TOWNBEFORE' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                    FROM FW_CODE C
                                    WHERE ((C.CODE_ID = 'TOWNBEFORE' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'TOWNBEFORE'))
                                      AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM FW_CODE C2 WHERE ((C2.CODE_ID = 'TOWNBEFORE' AND C2.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C2.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C2.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'TOWNBEFORE')) AND C2.CODE = C.CODE
                                                                                 AND (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYBEFORE' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYBEFORE || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END > CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYBEFORE' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYBEFORE || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END OR (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYBEFORE' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYBEFORE || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END = CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYBEFORE' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYBEFORE || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AND (C2.CODE_ID < C.CODE_ID OR (C2.CODE_ID = C.CODE_ID AND NVL(C2.SORT_ORDER, 1E9) < NVL(C.SORT_ORDER, 1E9))))))
                                      AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'CITYAFTER' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                   FROM FW_CODE C
                                   WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'CITYAFTER' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                     AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'TOWNAFTER' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                   FROM FW_CODE C
                                   WHERE ((C.CODE_ID = 'TOWNAFTER' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'TOWNAFTER'))
                                     AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM FW_CODE C2 WHERE ((C2.CODE_ID = 'TOWNAFTER' AND C2.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C2.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C2.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'TOWNAFTER')) AND C2.CODE = C.CODE
                                                                                AND (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYAFTER' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYAFTER || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END > CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYAFTER' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYAFTER || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END OR (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYAFTER' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYAFTER || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END = CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'CITYAFTER' AND INSTR('|' || I.CITYAFTER || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AND (C2.CODE_ID < C.CODE_ID OR (C2.CODE_ID = C.CODE_ID AND NVL(C2.SORT_ORDER, 1E9) < NVL(C.SORT_ORDER, 1E9))))))
                                     AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'NATIONBEFORE' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                      FROM FW_CODE C
                                      WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'NATIONBEFORE' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                        AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'NATIONAFTER' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                     FROM FW_CODE C
                                     WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'NATIONAFTER' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                       AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'DIVISIONBUSINESS1' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                           FROM FW_CODE C
                                           WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'DIVISIONBUSINESS1' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                             AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'DIVISIONBUSINESS2' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                           FROM FW_CODE C
                                           WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'DIVISIONBUSINESS2' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                             AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'DIVISIONBUSINESS3' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                           FROM FW_CODE C
                                           WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'DIVISIONBUSINESS3' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                             AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PROGRESS' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                  FROM FW_CODE C
                                  WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PROGRESS' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                    AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO1' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                            FROM FW_CODE C
                                            WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO1' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                              AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO3' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                            FROM FW_CODE C
                                            WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO3' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                              AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO4_CM' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                               FROM FW_CODE C
                                               WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO4_CM' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                                 AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO4_DE' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                               FROM FW_CODE C
                                               WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO4_DE' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                                 AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO2' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                            FROM FW_CODE C
                                            WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO2' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                              AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO5_CO' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                               FROM FW_CODE C
                                               WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO5_CO' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                                 AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'PARTICIPATIONINFO5_CM' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                               FROM FW_CODE C
                                               WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'PARTICIPATIONINFO5_CM' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                                 AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'FACILITIESTYPE' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                        FROM FW_CODE C
                                        WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'FACILITIESTYPE' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                          AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'REGIONLEVEL1' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                      FROM FW_CODE C
                                      WHERE C.CODE_ID = 'REGIONLEVEL1' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL
                                        AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'REGIONLEVEL2' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                      FROM FW_CODE C
                                      WHERE ((C.CODE_ID = 'REGIONLEVEL2' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL2'))
                                        AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM FW_CODE C2 WHERE ((C2.CODE_ID = 'REGIONLEVEL2' AND C2.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C2.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C2.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL2')) AND C2.CODE = C.CODE
                                                                                   AND (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL1' AND INSTR('|' || I.REGIONLEVEL1 || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END > CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL1' AND INSTR('|' || I.REGIONLEVEL1 || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END OR (CASE WHEN C2.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C2.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL1' AND INSTR('|' || I.REGIONLEVEL1 || '|', '|' || TRIM(C2.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END = CASE WHEN C.PARENT_CODE IS NOT NULL AND ((REGEXP_REPLACE(TRIM(C.PARENT_ID), '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL1' AND INSTR('|' || I.REGIONLEVEL1 || '|', '|' || TRIM(C.PARENT_CODE) || '|') > 0)) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AND (C2.CODE_ID < C.CODE_ID OR (C2.CODE_ID = C.CODE_ID AND NVL(C2.SORT_ORDER, 1E9) < NVL(C.SORT_ORDER, 1E9))))))
                                        AND C.CODE = TO_CHAR(TRIM(D.PROPERTYVALUE1)))
           WHEN N'REGIONLEVEL3' THEN (SELECT MIN(C.CODE_NM)
                                      FROM FW_CODE C
                                      WHERE ((C.CODE_ID = 'REGIONLEVEL3' AND C.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL3'))
                                        AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM FW_CODE C2 WHERE ((C2.CODE_ID = 'REGIONLEVEL3' AND C2.PARENT_ID IS NULL) OR (C2.PARENT_ID IS NOT NULL AND REGEXP_REPLACE(C2.CODE_ID, '_[0-9]+$', '') = 'REGIONLEVEL3')) AND C2.CODE = C.CODE
